      </p>
      <p>
        <b>usage</b>: If benefits do not outweigh harms of continued opioid therapy, clinicians should optimize other therapies and work with patients to taper opioids to lower dosages or to taper and discontinue opioids.
      </p>
      <p>
        <b>copyright</b>: © CDC 2016+.
